SUMMARY:Friends of Wesleyville Village - Annual Country Market and Nature Fest
DESCRIPTION:The Friends of Wesleyville Village invite families to drive out beautiful Lakeshore Road on Sunday\, May 31st to visit our heritage village for the annual Country Market\nand Nature Fest. \nWesleyville Village comes alive each spring with this much-loved tradition\, welcoming visitors of all ages to experience its charm and heritage. This year’s event takes place on Sunday\, May 31st\, 2026 from 10 am to 4 pm at historic Wesleyville Village\, with parking located at 2082 Lakeshore Road\, Port Hope\, ON L1A 3V7. \nFamilies can browse through tables from local vendors featuring hand-crafted products\, plants and food or enjoy a peaceful spring stroll through the nature trail. Visitors are invited to tour the village and learn about conservation progress and plans for the future\, including an Ontario Power Generation project for New Nuclear At Wesleyville. A restored reception area in the centre of the village is open to the public and displays in the 125 year-old one-room schoolhouse will help visitors to imagine rural life a century ago.
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/friends-of-wesleyville-village-annual-country-market-and-nature-fest/
ORGANIZER;CN="Friends of Wesleyville Village":MAILTO:friendsofwesleyvillevillage@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
